    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d65">

                <pb facs="0088" n="78" sameAs="frus:frus1943China/pg78"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Minister for Foreign Affairs</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Soong</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to Mr. Harry L.
                        Hopkins, Special Assistant to President Roosevelt </hi><anchor n="94a"
                        xml:id="d65-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-07-21">21 July, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Harry</hi>: My departure has been delayed till
                    tomorrow morning owing to engine trouble.</p>
                <pb facs="0089" n="79" xml:id="pg79"/>
                <p>Generalissimo cabled me that it would be awkward for United Nations’ relations,
                    and Sino-Russian relations in particular, if he goes thru Siberia without seeing
                    Stalin. Therefore he prefers the rendezvous to be somewhere else than
                    Alaska.</p>
                <p>If the President desires to advance the date of the meeting to some time in
                    August or September, he would be able to make it, provided he is given two
                    weeks’ notice.</p>
                <p>He requests me to proceed to London according to programme, but to be in
                    readiness to return &amp; participate in the conference whenever the President
                    desires it.</p>
                <p>Hoping that you will have a nice little rest in New Hampshire</p>
                <p>Sincerely</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>T. V. [<hi rendition="#small-caps">Soong</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
